  "changes": [
    "A car the player bumps while changing lanes, or one left overlapping the player, no longer traps it: cars waiting for the player let it drive off, overlapping vehicles may move apart, and the bump still counts as one collision",
    "Same-direction cars stop at the player body instead of driving into it, also when the player is angled across two lanes",
    "A lane reset clears cars off the reset point while the screen is dark; they return out of sight",
    "Ambient cars that leave the route or drop 150 m behind return past the visible road ahead, or stay away near the finish, instead of appearing 6 m before the destination",
    "Scoring, the 10 summary fields, per-round fields, the wrong-way event and its reaction-time rules are unchanged"
  ],
  "sourceCommit": "9e8c7413",
